WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:04.810
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

00:04.810 --> 00:12.530
Asano hitogomi o nagamete coffee nondeiru
Watching a crowd in the morning, and drinking coffee

00:13.450 --> 00:21.450
Aseri nado naikano youni hitoni wa mieru daro
People must see me as if I don't have any worries

00:22.080 --> 00:29.920
lma menomae ni atomodori dekinai jikan ga
I know that the time I will never be able to get back

00:30.710 --> 00:38.220
Tashika ni nagareteru koto o watashi wa shitteru
Is moving in front of me

00:38.430 --> 00:47.440
Marude kyou shika nai toiu ikikata o shitemita toki
If I live like today is the last day of my life

00:47.730 --> 00:55.490
Saisho ni nani ga mieru darou
I wonder what I can see first

00:56.570 --> 01:00.830
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:01.240 --> 01:09.250
Sore ga donnani chiisana hikari demo ii
I don't care no matter how small the light is

01:09.750 --> 01:11.750
Sugata o misete hoshii
I just wish to see its shape

01:11.750 --> 01:16.010
Oh please come down like an angel
Oh please come down like an angel

01:16.680 --> 01:22.470
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.470 --> 01:22.680
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
lma no kimochi sonomama hanaseru
I want to meet someone

01:22.680 --> 01:29.190
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest
Sonna hito ni deaitai
Who I can tell my honest feelings to

01:29.190 --> 01:30.980
Mermaid Forest
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology

01:37.490 --> 01:41.990
Episode 5
Mermaid Forest
(Part II)

02:17.190 --> 02:20.120
Exchange your heads?

02:24.100 --> 02:28.400
Yes, Doctor, my head with hers.

02:31.740 --> 02:33.760
Please don't do such a foolish thing.

02:34.040 --> 02:39.000
I want this girl's immortal body.

02:40.310 --> 02:43.610
Towa, why go so far?

02:45.020 --> 02:48.080
Because I don't want to die, yet.

02:49.120 --> 02:53.450
Or Sawa, will you take me
to the Mermaid Mound?

02:57.200 --> 02:58.790
Anything but that...

02:59.260 --> 03:02.360
Oh. That's a pity.

03:02.730 --> 03:05.570
If only I could've acquired
mermaid flesh...

03:05.570 --> 03:09.560
she would've been able to live too.

03:15.780 --> 03:17.080
You beast!

03:31.100 --> 03:33.830
<i>Hang on, Mana.</i>
<i>I'm coming for you.</i>

03:57.590 --> 03:58.650
<i>Mana.</i>

04:15.510 --> 04:20.270
Now, Doctor. Please begin.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.080
I can't.

04:29.450 --> 04:34.720
What's the matter, Doctor?
You've been helping me all this time.

04:36.030 --> 04:39.590
Until now, they were all dead.

04:40.030 --> 04:43.090
Oh, that's right.

04:43.540 --> 04:44.930
I'm sorry.

04:46.500 --> 04:47.470
Then...

04:49.210 --> 04:51.800
I'll do it.

05:15.000 --> 05:16.560
Please wait!

05:17.770 --> 05:19.000
Sister...

05:21.310 --> 05:25.040
I'll tell you where
the Mermaid Mound is.

05:26.310 --> 05:27.840
So please, that girl...

05:29.510 --> 05:32.850
Oh...you are going to tell me.

05:42.830 --> 05:46.130
Towa, why even bring this girl along?

05:47.030 --> 05:51.230
I won't feel secure until
we actually reach the Mermaid Mound.

05:52.170 --> 05:57.130
If Sawa is lying, I'm going to cut off
this girl's head right on the spot.

06:00.810 --> 06:01.610
Mana.

06:04.550 --> 06:06.680
Where are you? Mana.

06:20.000 --> 06:21.300
Hey, all of you!

06:21.730 --> 06:24.220
Oh, you've come back to life already?

06:24.570 --> 06:25.800
Release me!

06:26.970 --> 06:28.940
Yuta! Yuta!

06:29.670 --> 06:33.410
Be quiet.
He's probably become dog food by now.

06:33.950 --> 06:35.470
Yuta!

06:36.050 --> 06:37.070
Mana...

06:40.490 --> 06:41.380
Mana...

06:48.390 --> 06:49.520
Mana!

06:59.440 --> 07:02.410
This is the Mermaid Mound...

07:03.340 --> 07:05.210
Underneath this boulder...

07:10.080 --> 07:12.480
Now, you're coming with us.

07:12.480 --> 07:14.850
What are you doing,
get your hands off me!

07:14.850 --> 07:17.190
I won't hurt you anymore.

07:17.590 --> 07:21.820
Ouch! Get your hands off me!
You insolent woman!

07:22.630 --> 07:24.150
Be quiet!

07:24.430 --> 07:25.230
You!

07:26.760 --> 07:27.820
Stop it!

07:29.870 --> 07:30.930
Let go!

07:46.350 --> 07:50.720
This is where the lifeblood
that you gave me came from.

07:51.920 --> 07:53.910
The mermaid is down there.

07:58.500 --> 07:59.660
The mermaid.

08:01.870 --> 08:03.060
It's the mermaid.

08:04.340 --> 08:07.070
Look, I've found it at last.

08:11.340 --> 08:12.930
There's something there!

08:16.480 --> 08:17.680
Deformed One?

08:21.120 --> 08:22.210
That's...

08:23.690 --> 08:25.880
What's that, Sawa?

08:26.720 --> 08:29.920
As the heir to the Mermaid Mound,
you know, don't you?

08:33.360 --> 08:39.740
It's a human being who ate mermaid
flesh and failed to become immortal.

08:45.110 --> 08:47.340
A human who failed to become...

08:57.860 --> 08:59.320
Now you see, don't you?

09:02.960 --> 09:05.360
You shouldn't eat mermaid flesh.

09:06.360 --> 09:08.800
Yuta! Yuta!

09:09.470 --> 09:12.300
Mana, you look well.

09:15.710 --> 09:18.470
And you look awfully tired.

09:20.350 --> 09:22.910
Yeah, thanks to her.

09:23.720 --> 09:25.720
I'd tell you not to interfere...

09:25.720 --> 09:30.280
but you don't seem to have
enough strength to do so.

09:32.190 --> 09:33.120
Listen.

09:34.630 --> 09:36.750
Mermaid flesh is...

09:37.130 --> 09:39.790
a poison, a deadly poison.

09:44.100 --> 09:46.540
Not everyone becomes immortal.

09:47.240 --> 09:50.140
Those who fail turn
into one of those things.

09:50.610 --> 09:53.440
Besides, that arm of yours...

09:54.780 --> 09:58.980
It became like that just by taking
the lifeblood of the mermaid.

09:59.820 --> 10:03.620
Imagine what'll happen
if you actually eat mermaid flesh.

10:04.760 --> 10:08.720
Is that supposed to be a threat?
You're alive.

10:09.930 --> 10:11.020
And so is she.

10:12.360 --> 10:15.860
It took me 500 years to find her.

10:16.830 --> 10:19.740
I was all alone until then.

10:21.540 --> 10:25.240
Mermaid flesh changes
the human body entirely.

10:25.880 --> 10:28.810
Only one person in every few decades...

10:29.350 --> 10:33.610
No...every few centuries can
endure such a drastic mutation.

10:34.150 --> 10:39.680
Oh. But it doesn't matter to me
which way it turns out.

10:43.430 --> 10:44.730
What are you doing?

10:46.960 --> 10:49.260
Now, please go get it.

10:52.470 --> 10:54.130
The mermaid flesh.

10:54.270 --> 10:55.430
Mana!

11:03.970 --> 11:13.980
Rumiko Takahashi Anthology
Mermaid Forest

11:17.930 --> 11:18.920
Deformed One!

11:20.970 --> 11:21.860
Mana!

11:22.870 --> 11:25.600
Yuta! You're in no shape to!

11:26.370 --> 11:28.740
This isn't the time to be
saying such a thing!

11:41.390 --> 11:42.320
Yuta!

11:42.850 --> 11:46.090
Get a hold of yourselves.
You're immortals, aren't you?

11:46.420 --> 11:47.520
You!

11:48.730 --> 11:51.160
Go and get the mermaid quickly.

11:51.760 --> 11:54.320
Otherwise, you won't be
able to get out of there.

11:54.900 --> 11:58.840
You! Just wait!
We'll be out in no time!

11:59.740 --> 12:00.970
Give it here, Mana.

12:01.270 --> 12:03.760
The wounded should
keep quiet and rest!

12:14.690 --> 12:15.850
Mana!

12:24.500 --> 12:25.720
You beast!

12:39.180 --> 12:41.150
Mana, get over here!

13:07.100 --> 13:07.930
Yuta!

13:09.110 --> 13:11.670
Yuta, get up, Yuta!

13:19.720 --> 13:21.340
I thank you both.

13:22.490 --> 13:23.420
Don't!

13:24.960 --> 13:28.290
My wish will be granted at last.

13:29.030 --> 13:29.760
Towa...

13:29.760 --> 13:30.850
Please stop...

13:46.210 --> 13:49.770
It was alive...

13:51.880 --> 13:56.840
It continued to live in this state...

14:00.020 --> 14:01.650
Just like me...

14:09.970 --> 14:10.630
Don't eat it!

14:16.910 --> 14:17.700
Sawa.

14:29.550 --> 14:30.420
Here.

14:32.190 --> 14:33.350
What?

14:36.730 --> 14:37.790
Eat it.

14:39.100 --> 14:41.720
I kept looking for the
mermaid for such a long time...

14:42.100 --> 14:44.690
because I wanted you to eat it.

14:46.800 --> 14:47.860
Towa...

14:48.570 --> 14:49.870
What are you?

14:51.510 --> 14:54.780
Eat it. It was actually
you who longed...

14:54.780 --> 14:57.910
to obtain eternal youth and immortality.

14:58.350 --> 15:01.410
Towa, what are you saying?

15:02.850 --> 15:07.190
She tested the effectiveness
of the mermaid on me...

15:08.260 --> 15:09.890
her elder sister.

15:11.300 --> 15:11.820
What...

15:13.060 --> 15:14.090
That's...

15:14.930 --> 15:17.700
Isn't that right, Sawa?

15:20.810 --> 15:24.430
Because we're twins.

15:25.580 --> 15:29.240
We were originally one person.

15:32.780 --> 15:34.720
<i>Sawa! How dare you!</i>

15:35.720 --> 15:38.690
<i>I told you so many times</i>
<i>not to open the Mermaid Mound!</i>

15:39.120 --> 15:41.280
<i>I'm so sorry, Father!</i>

15:41.930 --> 15:46.920
<i>You don't understand a thing!</i>
<i>You don't understand what it is!</i>

15:48.030 --> 15:51.000
<i>Have I not told you that mermaid</i>
<i>flesh is a powerful poison and...</i>

15:51.000 --> 15:55.630
<i>no one has ever obtained</i>
<i>eternal youth and immortality?!</i>

16:03.650 --> 16:05.410
<i>She knew...</i>

16:08.590 --> 16:12.040
<i>Sister, if I inherited</i>
<i>the Mermaid Mound...</i>

16:12.160 --> 16:14.520
<i>I would eat mermaid flesh</i>
<i>before anyone.</i>

16:15.560 --> 16:17.690
<i>Why would you, Sawa?</i>

16:18.660 --> 16:24.400
<i>Because, isn't it wonderful to remain</i>
<i>forever young and beautiful?</i>

16:27.370 --> 16:30.000
My time has stood still since then.

16:31.080 --> 16:35.880
Living in confinement, I could not tell
how much time had passed but...

16:37.180 --> 16:41.410
I could see for certain that my doctor
Shiina was getting older and older.

16:43.190 --> 16:45.090
<i>It's a feast today.</i>

16:45.260 --> 16:48.230
<i>Yes, Young Lady</i>
<i>Sawa's getting married.</i>

16:50.590 --> 16:51.360
<i>Oh...</i>

16:53.300 --> 16:55.300
No matter how many
seasons had gone by...

16:55.300 --> 16:57.290
no matter how much time
had passed...

16:57.500 --> 16:59.490
I remained unchanged.

17:00.240 --> 17:03.260
But my surroundings
steadily changed.

17:05.210 --> 17:07.230
<i>Mother, who's that?</i>

17:07.510 --> 17:11.140
<i>You must not enter here.</i>
<i>Now, get out quickly.</i>

17:11.580 --> 17:13.410
<i>Sawa! It's you, isn't it?</i>

17:21.330 --> 17:24.920
<i>Sawa's son has been killed in the war.</i>

17:25.530 --> 17:26.500
<i>Oh.</i>

17:33.900 --> 17:37.840
<i>Sister, Father has passed away.</i>

17:38.780 --> 17:39.740
<i>Oh.</i>

17:40.980 --> 17:43.280
<i>My husband and son are dead.</i>

17:44.280 --> 17:47.550
<i>All we have now is each other.</i>

17:49.020 --> 17:51.040
<i>Why are you crying, Sawa?</i>

17:52.290 --> 17:55.090
<i>We were born into this world with</i>
<i>the same face and same body...</i>

17:56.360 --> 18:00.320
<i>but only you were married,</i>
<i>gave birth to a child, and raised him.</i>

18:00.930 --> 18:03.090
<i>Living the life of an ordinary woman.</i>

18:04.300 --> 18:07.400
<i>And even now, you have the luxury</i>
<i>of getting old and eventually dying.</i>

18:14.910 --> 18:16.570
<i>I will not let you die.</i>

18:21.390 --> 18:23.380
Here, eat.

18:24.820 --> 18:25.850
Eat it!

18:26.960 --> 18:32.330
Will you become a monster, or
live forever in that decrepit body?

18:34.130 --> 18:35.030
Here!

19:04.200 --> 19:05.560
A heart attack.

19:23.350 --> 19:24.610
It's so unfair of her...

19:28.290 --> 19:39.690
For this day...I've lived only for
this day. But it's all over now.

19:43.270 --> 19:47.360
Please burn it.
Burn the Mermaid Mound.

19:51.180 --> 19:53.510
Everything that's
connected to mermaids...

19:56.710 --> 19:58.010
Please burn everything...

20:02.150 --> 20:03.810
Everything...

20:10.030 --> 20:13.220
Is this what you wanted, Towa?

20:16.570 --> 20:19.200
I tried to help her
get out of this place many times.

20:19.900 --> 20:22.340
You were her?

20:23.370 --> 20:24.670
Fiancé.

20:26.210 --> 20:30.810
<i>Towa, let's get out of here.</i>
<i>I'll be with you until the day I die.</i>

20:32.080 --> 20:34.880
<i>Thank you, Doctor.</i>

20:36.290 --> 20:41.120
<i>But there's something I must do here.</i>

20:46.560 --> 20:48.330
Revenge...

20:51.900 --> 20:56.130
Towa never even had any
thoughts of me during her life.

20:57.570 --> 21:02.030
All she was focused on was Sawa,
the other version of her.

21:28.470 --> 21:36.980
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

21:38.360 --> 21:46.860
ltsumade kakaruno to anata wa warau kedo
"How long does it take?" You smiled at me

21:48.320 --> 21:57.210
Dorekurai oboete iru hidoku naki nagara
How much do you remember? I cried hard

21:58.250 --> 22:07.760
Dorekurai oboete iru anokoto to ieba
How much do you remember if I talk about "that thing"?

22:12.890 --> 22:21.900
ltsumademo mada utsumuite
I still look down

22:22.860 --> 22:31.370
Tobikoe rarenai mizutamari
I can't jump over the puddle

22:32.490 --> 22:42.000
Wakaranakunaru moshikasuruto
I'm confused

22:42.340 --> 22:51.850
Kawarenai no wa watashi dake kana
Maybe I'm the only one who still can't change

22:56.770 --> 23:06.360
Mukashi no koto datowa mada katazuke rarenai
It's just something in the past, but I still can't forget it

23:17.010 --> 23:18.110
Hey, Yuta.

23:19.080 --> 23:22.350
Is it so hard to live your life alone?

23:26.790 --> 23:27.920
For instance...

23:28.590 --> 23:30.960
What would you do if I disappeared?

23:36.100 --> 23:36.830
I'd look for you.

23:37.530 --> 23:39.090
And if you still couldn't find me?

23:39.740 --> 23:40.830
I'd look for you more.

23:42.110 --> 23:44.940
<i>Really, can't she say</i>
<i>that she'd miss me...</i>

23:44.940 --> 23:46.200
<i>or she'd be sad or something?</i>

23:46.940 --> 23:50.400
I'd keep looking and looking.
I'd keep looking as long as I live.

23:50.980 --> 23:53.450
Yeah, all right, all right, thanks.

23:53.950 --> 23:56.550
I'd keep looking, looking,
and looking for you.

23:56.720 --> 23:58.620
OK, OK, I appreciate it.

24:06.230 --> 24:10.630
Where am I? Those big eyes,
is that a Deformed One?

24:12.000 --> 24:15.600
No. Did you save me?

24:16.740 --> 24:21.340
Are you living here all alone in
this mountain? Aren't you lonely?

24:22.380 --> 24:24.040
Why don't you go down
to the village below?

24:25.320 --> 24:29.410
No, don't shoot!
He's not a monster! He's human!

24:30.650 --> 24:30.690
Episode 6
The End of the Dream

24:30.690 --> 24:34.090
Episode 6
The End of the Dream
Next, Episode 6
"The End of the Dream."

24:34.090 --> 24:34.980
Episode 6
The End of the Dream
